# Nothing is required here at the moment.
#
# Google Maps is switched off to avoid Google Cloud billing. The booking form's pickup and
# drop-off address search uses Photon (https://photon.komoot.io), which needs no key.
# The old setting is kept for reference in case billing is enabled later:
#
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=replace-with-your-restricted-browser-key
